{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HEARTWARMING ADVENTURE FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toto\u2019s Journey is a fun family adventure full of mysteries, friendship and discoveries. Explore the secrets of a magical world, meet new allies and solve puzzles. But will you reveal the secrets of the storm and find the way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/c90ddbe93dbebdf58d840236c17a0ba2.avif?t=1768833067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras_big/c90ddbe93dbebdf58d840236c17a0ba2.avif?t=1768833067 width=800 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT THE ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all creatures in this land are friendly. From stealth encounters to thrilling chase scenes, Toto must rely on his instincts to avoid threats. Sneak past hostile creatures, distract enemies with clever tricks, or use the environment to avoid danger. Every meeting is a test of skill and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/fc4c2fda3a1ddbc30f7845679639c391.avif?t=1768833067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras_big/fc4c2fda3a1ddbc30f7845679639c391.avif?t=1768833067 width=800 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE ENIGMATIC PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path before is full of riddling puzzles that test your wit and creativity. Unlock doors, restore broken artifacts, and control the light and shadow to reveal the ancient secrets of this land. With each puzzle solved, Toto grows stronger and unlocks new magical abilities that will help him to find his owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/00be7d1aadaa892efff5f5e2e6306f6b.avif?t=1768833067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras_big/00be7d1aadaa892efff5f5e2e6306f6b.avif?t=1768833067 width=800 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GO ON A MAGICAL JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in the heart of a mystical storm, Toto \u2014 the brave and loyal dog \u2014 must go on a journey through the world to which he has been swept away by a magical hurricane. Separated from his owner, he goes on a dangerous adventure across enchanted land meeting strange creatures, ancient puzzles, and powerful magic. Toto must find his owner taken by the magical storm, as well as to help new allies and unravel the secrets of this enchanted land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/274f316180f6194982347ad1d73bf5f6.avif?t=1768833067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras_big/274f316180f6194982347ad1d73bf5f6.avif?t=1768833067 width=800 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of fairy tale locations. From the dense forests where the Lion hides to the mechanical ruins of the Iron Knight- each location presents unique puzzles, characters, and challenges. Navigate through the world, discover hidden paths, and discover long-lost secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/e544dc8b42a8ea862137b60cd3dc914b.avif?t=1768833067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras_big/e544dc8b42a8ea862137b60cd3dc914b.avif?t=1768833067 width=800 height=438 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724300?t=1768833067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/3e619bc8ae01285082babb9db1ed241fb8cd6cd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768833067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/ea1f32b6b8affa0dffedfe256723beede3b09c8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768833067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/ea1f32b6b8affa0dffedfe256723beede3b09c8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768833067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HEARTWARMING ADVENTURE FOR THE WHOLE FAMILY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toto\u2019s Journey is a fun family adventure full of mysteries, friendship and discoveries. Explore the secrets of a magical world, meet new allies and solve puzzles. But will you reveal the secrets of the storm and find the way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras/c90ddbe93dbebdf58d840236c17a0ba2.avif?t=1768833067\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724300/extras_big/c90ddbe93dbebdf58d840236c17a0ba2.avif?t=1768833067 width=800 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT THE ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all creatures in this land are friendly. From stealth encounters to t